# Where the live dashboard is served from. The marketing site and the dashboard are
# two applications and may sit on a subdomain, behind a path, or on separate hosts.
#
# Unset, the landing page links to the sample sections on the page itself rather than
# to a dead URL, and the call-to-action wording changes to match.
#
# Local development, with the dashboard running on its required port:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DASHBOARD_URL=http://localhost:5173
#
# Production:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DASHBOARD_URL=https://dashboard.keels.app
